@startuml Patient Registration and Login
title Patient Registration and Login Flow

actor Patient
participant "React App" as App
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Database" as DB

== Registration ==
Patient -> App: Enter email, password, name
App -> Auth: signUp(email, password, metadata)
Auth -> DB: Create user record
Auth -> Patient: Send verification email
Auth --> App: Return user session
App --> Patient: Show dashboard

== Login ==
Patient -> App: Enter email, password
App -> Auth: signInWithPassword(email, password)
Auth -> DB: Verify credentials
Auth --> App: Return session token
App -> DB: Fetch user profile
DB --> App: Return user data
App --> Patient: Show dashboard

== Password Reset ==
Patient -> App: Click "Forgot Password"
App -> Auth: resetPasswordForEmail(email)
Auth -> Patient: Send reset email
Patient -> Auth: Click reset link
Auth --> Patient: Show reset form
Patient -> Auth: Submit new password
Auth -> DB: Update password
Auth --> Patient: Redirect to login

@enduml

@startuml Symptom Checker Flow
title Symptom Checker and Disease Prediction

actor Patient
participant "Symptom Checker" as SC
participant "Disease Database" as DDB
participant "Prediction Engine" as PE
participant "Supabase" as DB
participant "Doctor List" as DL

Patient -> SC: Type symptom (e.g., "fe")
SC -> DDB: Filter symptoms by input
DDB --> SC: Return matching symptoms
SC --> Patient: Show suggestions dropdown

Patient -> SC: Click symptom suggestion
SC -> DDB: Get follow-up symptoms
DDB --> SC: Return symptom types
SC --> Patient: Show symptom type options

Patient -> SC: Select symptom type
SC --> Patient: Show severity modal
Patient -> SC: Select severity (mild/moderate/severe)
SC -> SC: Add symptom to list

Patient -> SC: Click "Analyze Symptoms"
SC -> PE: predictDisease(symptoms)
PE -> DDB: Match symptoms with diseases
DDB -> PE: Calculate confidence scores
PE -> PE: Apply required symptoms filter
PE -> PE: Sort by confidence
PE --> SC: Return prediction results

SC -> DB: Save symptom check record
DB --> SC: Confirm saved

SC -> DL: Get doctors by specialization
DL --> SC: Return matching doctors
SC --> Patient: Show diagnosis results page

Patient -> SC: Click "Book Appointment"
SC --> Patient: Open appointment modal

@enduml

@startuml Appointment Booking Flow
title Patient Appointment Booking

actor Patient
participant "Appointments Page" as AP
participant "Supabase API" as API
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Doctor Portal" as DP
actor Doctor

== View Doctors ==
Patient -> AP: Navigate to Appointments
AP -> API: GET /doctors
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM doctors
DB --> API: Return doctors list
API --> AP: Return doctors data
AP --> Patient: Display doctor cards

== Filter by Specialization ==
Patient -> AP: Click specialization filter
AP -> AP: Filter doctors locally
AP --> Patient: Show filtered doctors

== Book Appointment ==
Patient -> AP: Click "Book" on doctor card
AP --> Patient: Show booking modal
Patient -> AP: Enter date, time, reason
AP -> API: POST /appointments
API -> DB: INSERT appointment record
DB --> API: Return appointment ID
API --> AP: Confirm booking
AP --> Patient: Show success message
AP -> AP: Refresh appointments list

== Doctor Reviews Appointment ==
DP -> DB: Check new appointments
DB --> DP: Return pending appointments
Doctor -> DP: Review appointment details
Doctor -> DP: Confirm/Reject appointment
DP -> DB: UPDATE appointment status
DB --> DP: Confirm update

== Patient Views Status ==
Patient -> AP: Check appointments
AP -> API: GET /appointments
API -> DB: SELECT appointments WHERE user_id
DB --> API: Return appointments
API --> AP: Return data
AP --> Patient: Show appointment status

@enduml

@startuml Doctor Portal Flow
title Doctor Portal - Appointment Management

actor Doctor
participant "Doctor Login" as DL
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Doctor Dashboard" as DD
participant "Database" as DB
participant "Patient" as Patient

== Doctor Login ==
Doctor -> DL: Enter email, password
DL -> Auth: signInWithPassword(email, password)
Auth -> DB: Verify doctor credentials
DB --> Auth: Return doctor profile
Auth --> DL: Return session
DL --> Doctor: Show doctor dashboard

== View Appointments ==
Doctor -> DD: Navigate to Appointments
DD -> DB: SELECT appointments WHERE doctor_id
DB --> DD: Return appointments list
DD --> Doctor: Display appointments

== Manage Appointment ==
Doctor -> DD: Click appointment
DD --> Doctor: Show appointment details

alt Confirm Appointment
    Doctor -> DD: Click "Confirm"
    DD -> DB: UPDATE status = 'Confirmed'
    DB --> DD: Confirm update
    DD --> Doctor: Show success message
else Reject Appointment
    Doctor -> DD: Click "Reject"
    DD --> Doctor: Show rejection reason modal
    Doctor -> DD: Enter rejection reason
    DD -> DB: UPDATE status = 'Rejected', reason
    DB --> DD: Confirm update
    DD --> Doctor: Show success message
end

== Add Diagnosis ==
Doctor -> DD: Enter diagnosis notes
Doctor -> DD: Enter prescription
DD -> DB: UPDATE appointment with diagnosis
DB --> DD: Confirm update
DD --> Doctor: Show success

== View Patient History ==
Doctor -> DD: Click patient name
DD -> DB: SELECT symptom_checks WHERE user_id
DB --> DD: Return patient history
DD --> Doctor: Display patient records

@enduml

@startuml Medicine Reminder Flow
title Medicine Reminder System

actor Patient
participant "Dashboard" as Dash
participant "Medicine Form" as MF
participant "Supabase" as DB
participant "Local Storage" as LS
participant "Notification Service" as NS

== Add Medicine ==
Patient -> Dash: Click "Add Medicine"
Dash --> Patient: Show medicine form
Patient -> MF: Enter name, dosage, frequency, time
MF -> DB: INSERT medicine record
DB --> MF: Return medicine ID
MF -> LS: Store reminder settings
LS --> MF: Confirm stored
MF --> Patient: Show success message

== View Medicines ==
Patient -> Dash: View medicine list
Dash -> DB: SELECT medicines WHERE user_id
DB --> Dash: Return medicines
Dash --> Patient: Display medicine cards

== Mark as Taken ==
Patient -> Dash: Click "Mark as Taken"
Dash -> DB: UPDATE last_taken timestamp
DB --> Dash: Confirm update
Dash --> Patient: Update UI

== Delete Medicine ==
Patient -> Dash: Click delete
Dash -> DB: DELETE medicine record
DB --> Dash: Confirm deletion
Dash -> LS: Remove reminder
LS --> Dash: Confirm removed
Dash --> Patient: Update list

== Reminder Notification ==
NS -> LS: Check scheduled reminders
LS --> NS: Return due reminders
NS -> NS: Create notification
NS --> Patient: Show browser notification
Patient -> NS: Click notification
NS --> Dash: Open medicine list

@enduml

@startuml Complete System Architecture
title Health Assistant System Architecture

actor Patient
actor Doctor
participant "React Frontend" as React
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Supabase Database" as DB
participant "Disease Prediction\nEngine (Client-side)" as Engine
participant "Supabase Storage" as Storage

== Patient Flow ==
Patient -> React: Access application
React -> Auth: Check session
Auth --> React: Return auth state

Patient -> React: Use symptom checker
React -> Engine: Analyze symptoms
Engine --> React: Return predictions
React -> DB: Save symptom check
React --> Patient: Show results

Patient -> React: Book appointment
React -> DB: Create appointment
DB --> React: Confirm booking
React --> Patient: Show confirmation

== Doctor Flow ==
Doctor -> React: Login to doctor portal
React -> Auth: Authenticate doctor
Auth -> DB: Verify doctor credentials
DB --> Auth: Return doctor data
Auth --> React: Return session
React --> Doctor: Show dashboard

Doctor -> React: View appointments
React -> DB: Fetch appointments
DB --> React: Return appointments
React --> Doctor: Display list

Doctor -> React: Update appointment
React -> DB: Save changes
DB --> React: Confirm update
React --> Doctor: Show success

== Data Storage ==
React -> DB: Store user data
React -> DB: Store appointments
React -> DB: Store symptom checks
React -> DB: Store medicines
React -> Storage: Store files (future)

@enduml

@startuml Mobile Login Issue - Current vs Fixed
title Mobile Login Issue Analysis

actor "Mobile User" as Mobile
participant "Login Form" as Form
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
participant "Session Manager" as Session

== Current Issue ==
Mobile -> Form: Enter credentials
Form -> Auth: signInWithPassword()
Auth --> Form: Return session
Form -> Session: Store session
note right: Issue: Session not persisting\non mobile browsers
Session --> Form: Session lost
Form --> Mobile: Redirect to login again

== Fixed Flow ==
Mobile -> Form: Enter credentials
Form -> Auth: signInWithPassword()
Auth --> Form: Return session
Form -> Session: Store with localStorage
Session -> Session: Set secure cookie
Session -> Session: Verify persistence
note right: Fix: Use localStorage + cookies\nwith proper mobile settings
Session --> Form: Session confirmed
Form --> Mobile: Redirect to dashboard
Mobile -> Form: Refresh page
Form -> Session: Check session
Session --> Form: Session valid
Form --> Mobile: Stay logged in

@enduml
